  <p class="why" style="margin-top:14px"><b>The same relationship this way &mdash; the Basketball courses &mdash; is correct but slow.</b> It fetches all 119 course files, one after another: <b>measured 71&nbsp;seconds</b> to render on stage (2026-10-01), against about 1&nbsp;second for &sect;3&rsquo;s single <code>courses.json</code> fetch. So it is <b>not rendered on this page</b>. Run it here if you want to see it:</p>
